    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arctic Wolves is an open-world action game that blends the charm of wolves with dynamic combat set in a snowy, fantasy-inspired world. As a player, you\u2019ll explore this winter landscape, meet various characters, and uncover their unique traits. Completing quests for these characters earns you currency, which you can use to buy weapons, houses, and vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide variety of locations to explore, you can roam the terrain on foot, soar in a helicopter, drive an ATV, or even command a tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326280/extras/4eb95d7f770caff88bf628839ff8dbf3.avif?t=1744550403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization is central to Arctic Wolves, giving you the ability to control your character\u2019s appearance entirely, down to specific details. You can also design custom NPCs who can join you on your journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326280/extras/fe299a3cb27efcfe8b555b886a8c40f8.avif?t=1744550403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those interested, the game includes optional NSFW content, featuring explicit character customization and interactive sex scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building out your personal spaces is also part of the experience; you can purchase furniture and decor to create your ideal apartment and upgrade your properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326280/extras/d9739941669115a65dbfcdbf328e0e4f.avif?t=1744550403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arctic Wolves invites players to create, explore, and battle in a unique world, where the freedom to customize and discover makes each adventure your own.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arctic Wolves is an open-world action game that blends the charm of wolves with dynamic combat set in a snowy, fantasy-inspired world. As a player, you\u2019ll explore this winter landscape, meet various characters, and uncover their unique traits. Completing quests for these characters earns you currency, which you can use to buy weapons, houses, and vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a wide variety of locations to explore, you can roam the terrain on foot, soar in a helicopter, drive an ATV, or even command a tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326280/extras/4eb95d7f770caff88bf628839ff8dbf3.avif?t=1744550403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization is central to Arctic Wolves, giving you the ability to control your character\u2019s appearance entirely, down to specific details. You can also design custom NPCs who can join you on your journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326280/extras/fe299a3cb27efcfe8b555b886a8c40f8.avif?t=1744550403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those interested, the game includes optional NSFW content, featuring explicit character customization and interactive sex scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building out your personal spaces is also part of the experience; you can purchase furniture and decor to create your ideal apartment and upgrade your properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326280/extras/d9739941669115a65dbfcdbf328e0e4f.avif?t=1744550403\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arctic Wolves invites players to create, explore, and battle in a unique world, where the freedom to customize and discover makes each adventure your own.</p>",
