        "notes": "Arctic Wolves contains mature content intended for adults. Players will encounter scenes of violence, a variety of weapons, including assault rifles and rocket launchers, blood (optional toggle), dead bodies, and strong language.\r\n\r\nThe game also offers customizable adult content:\r\nPlayers can fully personalize character appearances, with options to adjust detailed physical attributes and choose explicit clothing and features. There is also a option to spawn NPCs with these specific attributes.\r\n\r\nCharacters can engage in sexual interactions, with a variety of positions and scene settings, available in first-person POV (only for the player) or with an adjustable camera.  Sexual interactions can be initiated at any location in the game through character dialogue, or with beds and jacuzzis as specific interaction points. Adult-themed locations, such as a pub or a private house including BDSM props and sex toys can be found in the world. These props can also be accessed via the build-mode.\r\n\r\nAll sexual adult content is optional and requires player activation in the settings."
